      "name": "dsh-eye-care",
      "title": {
        "en": "Eye-care mode",
        "zh": "护眼模式"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Warms the whole Web interface into a paper-like palette for less blue light: one switch in Settings → General, layered over the current appearance with a separate warm palette for light and dark themes. The choice is stored per browser and applies immediately; turning the switch off restores the built-in colors.",
        "zh": "把整个 Web 界面换成暖色纸感配色，降低蓝光观感：设置 → 通用设置里一个开关，叠加在当前外观之上（浅色、深色各有一套暖色板）。开关状态按浏览器保存，切换即时生效；关掉开关就恢复内置配色。"
      },
      "author": "songze",
